<h1>Data Deletion Request</h1>

<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> May 2026</p>

<p>
Mak Digital Ventures allows users to request deletion of personal data associated with our apps,
including World Cup 2026 Hub, without deleting their full app account.
</p>

<h2>Request deletion of specific data</h2>

<p>
You may request deletion of specific app data such as profile details, favorite teams,
chat messages, reports, notification preferences, or other app activity data.
</p>

<p>
To request deletion, email us at:
<strong><a href="mailto:support@makdigitalventures.com">support@makdigitalventures.com</a></strong>
</p>

<p>Please include:</p>
<ul>
  <li>The app name</li>
  <li>The email address used in the app</li>
  <li>The type of data you want deleted</li>
  <li>A short note saying you want data deletion without deleting your account</li>
</ul>

<h2>Account deletion</h2>

<p>
If you want your full account and associated app data deleted, you may also request full account deletion
by emailing the same address.
</p>

<h2>Processing time</h2>

<p>
We will review and process deletion requests within a reasonable time, unless we are required to retain
limited information for legal, security, fraud prevention, or compliance purposes.
</p>

